# Ignore Analysis Directory

## Core Principle

Treat `analysis/` as **scratch / planning only**. Ignore it unless the user explicitly asks about a file there.

## Rules

- ❌ Do not read, update, verify, or cite `analysis/**` when checking whether docs are up to date
- ❌ Do not sync product docs with analysis plans (or the reverse) by default
- ❌ Do not suggest cleaning up analysis plans as follow-up work unless asked
- ✅ Use `docs/` (and code) as the source of truth for implemented behavior
- ✅ Only open `analysis/` when the user names it or clearly wants plan work there
